Name Type Default <code>appium:chromedriverExecutableDir</code> <code>string</code> See below <p>Custom path to a JSON file containing a mapping of webview/browser versions to the ChromeDriver versions that are capable of automating them, similarly to the following:</p> <pre><code>{
  "2.42": "63.0.3239",
  "2.41": "62.0.3202"
}
</code></pre> <p>The default value is <code>node_modules/appium-chromedriver/config/mapping.json</code> in the driver's installation directory.</p> <p>Refer to the Managing ChromeDriver guide for more details.</p>
